&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Build business cases and commercial models covering pricing, partner incentives, revenue sharing, support, and delivery responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Negotiate partner agreements in coordination with Mozilla leadership, Legal, Finance, Product, and Engineering&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Generate partner-led revenue through customer introductions, joint account planning, co-selling, and reseller activities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Plan joint marketing activities such as events, content, campaigns, customer stories, and market announcements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
