&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At least one example of a partnership you developed from initial contact to a signed agreement or active joint project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
