&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Mozilla is the non-profit-backed technology company behind pioneering products like Firefox, the privacy-focused browser. Every month, over 225 million people use Mozilla’s products. We’re a community of staff and volunteers committed to an internet that’s a global public resource—open, accessible, and safe for everyone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If you’re passionate about telling stories that move policy, shift mindsets, and help build a better internet, we want to hear from you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
